          "context": "4. Shaving hair: Does shaved hair grow back thicker?"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-071a33a71652::sentence-10",
          "documentId": "doc-071a33a71652",
          "text": "## Does shaving unwanted body hair makes it grow back thicker and darker?\n\n",
          "start": 314,
          "end": 389,
          "contextSpans": [],
          "context": "## Does shaving unwanted body hair makes it grow back thicker and darker?"
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-813ee535443b::sentence-14",
          "documentId": "doc-813ee535443b",
          "text": "After all, you’ve always been told that shaving your hair will make it grow back thicker … in exactly the spots where you don’t want luscious locks to grow.\n",
          "start": 820,
          "end": 977,
          "contextSpans": [
            {
              "id": "doc-813ee535443b::sentence-13",
              "documentId": "doc-813ee535443b",
              "text": "Policy\n",
              "start": 813,
              "end": 820,
              "direction": "PREVIOUS"
            }
          ],
          "context": "Policy After all, you’ve always been told that shaving your hair will make it grow back thicker … in exactly the spots where you don’t want luscious locks to grow."
        },
        {
          "id": "doc-813ee535443b::sentence-15",
          "documentId": "doc-813ee535443b",
          "text": "As it turns out, this is a myth: Shaving won’t make your hair regrow any thicker or faster. ",
          "start": 977,
          "end": 1069,
          "contextSpans": [
            {
              "id": "doc-813ee535443b::sentence-14",
              "documentId": "doc-813ee535443b",
