            },
            {
              "id": "doc-813ee535443b::sentence-16",
              "documentId": "doc-813ee535443b",
              "text": "But there’s some logic behind thinking it does.\n",
              "start": 1069,
              "end": 1117,
              "direction": "NEXT"
            }
          ],
          "context": "After all, you’ve always been told that shaving your hair will make it grow back thicker … in exactly the spots where you don’t want luscious locks to grow. As it turns out, this is a myth: Shaving won’t make your hair regrow any thicker or faster. But there’s some logic behind thinking it does."
